From af952c883d15b934e0806bcfcbd8362ba8f5805e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:44:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] SessionManager: add host discovery and background session
 probing

Hosts come from the local machine, ~/.ssh/config and the SSH Manager
profiles. Sessions are listed with one non-interactive ssh run per host,
reusing the connection.
